  "title": "Semtech Launches 5G RedCap Modem for Industrial IoT",
  "summary": "Semtech today announced the FX86E, a 5G RedCap modem designed for industrial IoT applications. It is built to operate across networks where carriers are investing in 5G RedCap infrastructure, enabling long product life in the field while helping industrial IoT customers.",
